msgctxt "woh_dec:123"
msgid "ACCESS ROOFTOP"
msgstr "前往屋頂"

#. Descripción de «ACCESS ROOFTOP» (woh_dec:123).
#. Diálogo o pensamiento entre << >>.
msgctxt "woh_dec:124"
msgid "<<I've overheard my parents talking about a horrible accident. They said that the girl's father went mad from grief...>>"
msgstr ""
"「我偷聽到父母在談論一場可怕的意外。\n"
"他們說那女生的父親因為過於悲痛，最後整個人發瘋了……」"

#. Opción de «ACCESS ROOFTOP» (woh_dec:123). Opciones: <<What's that?>> · The girl whispers · [GRAFT BEAR CLAWS TO YOUR TOES] · new random INJURY each mystery / +2 KICK damage.
#. Diálogo o pensamiento entre << >>.
msgctxt "woh_dec:125"
msgid "<<What's that?>>"
msgstr "「那是什麼？」"

#. Opción de «ACCESS ROOFTOP» (woh_dec:123). Opciones: <<What's that?>> · The girl whispers · [GRAFT BEAR CLAWS TO YOUR TOES] · new random INJURY each mystery / +2 KICK damage.
