msgid "The girl whispers"
msgstr "女孩小聲地說"

#. Opción de «ACCESS ROOFTOP» (woh_dec:123). Opciones: <<What's that?>> · The girl whispers · [GRAFT BEAR CLAWS TO YOUR TOES] · new random INJURY each mystery / +2 KICK damage.
msgctxt "woh_dec:127"
msgid "[GRAFT BEAR CLAWS TO YOUR TOES]"
msgstr "「將熊爪移植到腳趾上」"

#. Opción de «ACCESS ROOFTOP» (woh_dec:123). Opciones: <<What's that?>> · The girl whispers · [GRAFT BEAR CLAWS TO YOUR TOES] · new random INJURY each mystery / +2 KICK damage.
