msgid "PERFECT FORM"
msgstr "完美型態"

#. Opción de «THE PERFECT FORM» (woh_ichi:68). Opciones: [every 21% DOOM lowers all your stats by 1] · You take a step towards the Perfect Form. (-1 ALL STATS) · ZHECTAST · PERFECT FORM · every 21% DOOM lowers your stats by 1 · ---EH-ŻHAL, THE INCONCEIVABLE SADNESS---.
msgctxt "woh_ichi:74"
msgid "every 21% DOOM lowers your stats by 1"
msgstr "每增加 21% 末日就會使你的數值降低 1"

